    "implementation_delta": "Add PseudoCidIdentityRemoval@1 and quarantine random Qm/hex CID generators behind ipfs_accelerate_py.compatibility.simulation.pseudo_cid. Ordinary ipfs_accelerate_py constructors load CanonicalIPFSMultiformats instead of hashlib.sha256(...).hexdigest() labeled as a CID. Legacy store_to_ipfs is typed unavailable. HuggingFace cache and kit integration _generate_cid mint canonical CIDv1 from retained bytes. MockIPFSClient requires explicit simulation, mints canonical CIDs from file bytes, and never emits Qm-prefixed random strings. random_cid is refused even under explicit simulation because identity requires canonical bytes. Simulated stores stay Simulated and are not live. Live IPFS remains typed unavailable. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
